From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 21:01:52 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] overlay: Disable private space

Android 17 port of /e/OS a16 vendor/lineage 9e0eb9a8 ("Disable private
space"). The android.multiuser.enable_private_space_features flag it set
no longer exists in Android 17 (private space has launched), so disable
the private profile user type instead: with block_private_space_creation
enabled (all AOSP release configs), UserManager.canAddPrivateProfile()
then returns false and Settings no longer offers private space.

The launcher side (com.android.launcher3 enable_private_space) is set in
vendor/lineage's cp2a aconfig values.
---
 .../core/res/res/xml/config_user_types.xml    | 26 +++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 26 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 overlay/common/frameworks/base/core/res/res/xml/config_user_types.xml

diff --git a/overlay/common/frameworks/base/core/res/res/xml/config_user_types.xml b/overlay/common/frameworks/base/core/res/res/xml/config_user_types.xml
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..96ba4d8
--- /dev/null
+++ b/overlay/common/frameworks/base/core/res/res/xml/config_user_types.xml
@@ -0,0 +1,26 @@
+<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
+<!--
